# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Omiscera .gitignore
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Downloaded reference data. ~1.2 GB and fully regenerable at runtime - every
# fetcher re-downloads on a cache miss (STRING protein.links alone is 79 MB for
# human; GO/Reactome/MSigDB/GWAS bulk files make up the rest). Committing this
# would dwarf the source tree and go stale against the pinned upstream versions
# the fetchers already guard (e.g. MSIGDB_VERSION, STRING_VERSION).
cache/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class

# Editor / OS / OneDrive noise
.vscode/
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

# Claude Code's own local project config (machine-specific permissions, scheduled-task lock file) - internal
# tooling, not part of the app; not meant for public consumption.
.claude/

# Deliberately TRACKED, listed here so nobody "tidies" them away:
#   Data/ Data2/ Data3/   bundled example inputs the test suite depends on
#   Assets/               app logo and images
#   info/                 the per-module README documentation
#   tests/                the whole verification suite